  <title>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">Does AMR in livestock contribute to AMR in people in NE India? An interdisciplinary study.</narrative>
  </title>
  <description type="1">
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">Funding for high quality collaborative research projects between UK and indian researchers which will build UK-India teams focussed on AMR research, support development of truly interdisciplinary proposals, including those that take a &#x2018;One Health&#x2019; approach and develop outline research proposals that will make a tangible difference to tackling AMR in India. SDGs: 3</narrative>
  </description>
  <description type="2">
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">The fund addresses the UN sustainable development goals. It aims to maximise the impact of research and innovation to improve lives and opportunity in the developing world</narrative>
  </description>
